licensed under the MIT License. The complete terms are in `LICENSE-CODE`.

This category includes, in particular:

- `EndpointCoordinate.lean` and `EndpointCoordinate/*.lean`;
- `supplement/*.py` and `supplement/normality_audit/*.py`;
- `.github/workflows/`;
- `lakefile.toml`, `lake-manifest.json`, `lean-toolchain`, and requirements
